// Dialog :
"P4188135822" "When you return to the TV, the cartoon father is sitting on his couch watching TV, drinking beer, and eating snack food with a radioactive mime on one side and a lawyer on the other. <br><br>'So you see,' he says with idiot's wisdom, 'Television truly helps to bring people together. Some people find that hard to believe, but that's why we can force nerds to write scientific papers that prove it. Now if only we could get more people to watch Television...' <br><br>Father, Mime, and Lawyer all start puzzling over the problem as the episode comes to an end."
// RandomFameString :
"P417748516" "There are so many good things on Television these days, I have to spend more time watching and less time bettering myself."

