// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1285668191" "There's an old spy show playing on Television when you tune in. As you tune in, the elite team of espionage specialists are gathered around an old style of tape recorder, anxiously awaiting their latest top-secret impossible mission. The leader of the group stabs his finger down on the 'Play' button, and they all listen intently as the tape starts to play. <br><br>'Greetings, team,' the tape begins. 'Your mission today will be to stop the assassination of the Ambassador of West Libertalia by mercenary forces. But before I give you the details for that, I must address {VillainName}.' The rest of the spy team look surprised, but their grey haired leader nods grimly, and motions you closer as the tape continues to play. '{VillainName}, we need to use your high standing, power, and connections to assist Television. This will be your mission, if you choose to accept it.'"
// AcceptString :
"P1478352704" "Accept the mission"
// SendOffString :
"P2972508704" "The whole spy team seems relieved now that you've agreed to help Television. The tape continues to play. <br><br>'{VillainName}, the report you hold is vitally important for the future of Television. But before it can be submitted to Arbiter Daos for implementation, you need to get it approved by two other high-ranking members of Arachnos. Your first Target will be Viridian, the chief of counter-intelligence operations. Do whatever task he gives you, but you must get that signature. <br> Now, for the rest of you, the operation is simple. First, you'll have to pretend to be a traveling circus in need of a lion-tamer...'  The voice on the tape keeps talking, telling the people in the show what they need to know. But you know what you have to do."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3574027434" "Get Viridian's signature"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1277444859" "You'll need the signatures of at least two high ranking Arachnos figures before Arbiter Daos will consider implementing the suggestions in Dr. Aeon's paper. The Television told you to talk to Viridian first."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3748192836" "Okay, {VillainName}, I'll look at this report from Aeon. Really, I don't care. I have other problems. There's a thought. If you help me with my problem, I'll sign this for you. Here's the problem: The Malta Group. Normally, we both walk a line. Neither of us wants a shadow war. Too costly. But a cell of Malta operatives have crossed the line. Malta thinks they're just testing where the line is. They're wrong. They pushed it. I need someone to push them back. Wipe out the Malta cell. They're disguised as a small accountancy firm. When that's done, I'll sign anything you want. Leave the report with me. I'll wait for you to get back."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3841016024" "Wipe out Malta cell"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2522023949" "You remember what to do. Wipe out this cell of the Malta group, and Viridian will put his signature on the paper."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1843644372" "This is supposed to be a 'small accounting firm'? By what definition of 'Small'?"

