"P2967919327" "I've heard you were preparing a report for me, {VillainName}. Let me take a look. Hmm. More Television? Well, you did have Dr. Aeon as a co-author, and you have some very important people who've reviewed it. Considering your power and position, I'll have to take this into serious consideration. I'll forward this report directly to Lord Recluse himself. Thank you for bringing this to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3994409532" "You tune back in just at the climax of a massive space battle on the sci-fi show you were watching earlier. You watch the whole thing unfold and come down to a satisfying conclusion. There are a few quiet moments before the show's heroes realize that they've won, but then the celebration starts. The stern Station Commander takes a moment to address everyone over the public address system. <br><br>'We've won a great victory today, and I want to thank everyone. In particular, I'd like to thank {VillainName}, without whom, this whole victory would have been impossible. Let us look to today as the first day of a new galaxy! A galaxy of prosperity. A galaxy of opportunity. A galaxy of Television. That is all.'"
// RandomFameString :
"P2000425146" "I heard that Arachnos was increasing their troops' TV time. They must be trying to boost morale."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
